{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the largest quotient that can be formed using two numbers chosen from the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/9412d791f1964a1882fa83efc0a9fe9baa16b560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ -24, -3, -2, 1, 2, 8 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0704aff25123390338c49fe4e33a4f2b798f928f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -24 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"402\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the two chosen numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.  To maximize the quotient, we first have either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4e4cf9642b7481b099068513a4bc3e5aa9cebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24fa77595c9ef847d0b3c26779e276f1e88975a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, and from there we maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f42e32ea9361c740cbb968ee21d15749691f747c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> and minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/9224c384e6324a07e6f1fb851528d00fc475a260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|b|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>For the case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24fa77595c9ef847d0b3c26779e276f1e88975a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6ac46c970bbfde2bc4966429893b57807595850a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b363a32cd810f50e0f9af3b77fbf527304758be3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-2$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />, which gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29dd1553d6ac2be1a224948de64be5226cc70270.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-24)/(-2)=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />.  For the case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4e4cf9642b7481b099068513a4bc3e5aa9cebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1a0caf28dae25372408593f2d14ca238035568c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=8$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, which gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/42009bab37f8c67cfdfb8f07ebec9bdd80a613d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8/1=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/b/42b365fc752672c599dbfef9c6230093af35f8c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12&gt;8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Pro